<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any limited liability partnership which fails to comply with a direction given under subsection (2) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit and, in the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not exceeding five hundred ringgit for each day during which the offence continues after conviction. Registration of changes in particulars"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
