<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_17__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "A limited liability partnership which fails to comply with subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit and, in the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not exceeding five hundred ringgit for each day during which the offence continues after conviction. Registered office"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
