<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The documents kept under subsection (1) shall be made available for inspection and copying during ordinary business hours at the request of a partner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
