<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "If a limited liability partnership has changed its name under section 15, the former name of the limited liability partnership shall appear beneath its present name on every letterhead, invoice, bill, publication including electronic medium, website or other official documents issued by the limited liability partnership for a period of twelve months from the date of such change."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_20> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
