<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A limited liability partnership may carry on business with fewer than two partners for a period not exceeding six months or a longer period as may be determined by the Registrar upon an application from the remaining partner, provided that the period so extended by the Registrar does not exceed one year."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
