<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
