<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IX__cl_68__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "appears as at that date to be able to pay its debts as they become due in the normal course of business; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IX__cl_68__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IX__cl_68__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
