<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IX__cl_71__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Any order made by the court under this section shall direct that the notice of the order to be served on the Registrar in the manner as determined by the court and the Registrar shall, on receipt of the notice, rectify the register accordingly."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
