<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IX__cl_72__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IX__cl_72__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If a limited liability partnership fails to comply with the direction of the Registrar under subsection (1), the limited liability partnership and the compliance officer commit an offence. Service for electronic lodgement of documents"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
