<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_IX__cl_76> <https://schema.org/text> "A document may be served on a limited liability partnership by leaving it at or sending it by post to the registered office of the limited liability partnership. Power to issue guidelines, practice notes, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
