<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this section, the Registrar may by notice in writing require any partner or compliance officer of a limited liability partnership or any person to produce to him such books, minute books, registers or other documents as are in the custody or under the control of that partner, compliance officer or person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
