<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Without affecting the generality of subsection (1), the warrant issued by the Magistrate may authorize the search and seizure of—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
