<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_64__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_64__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who fails to comply with the order given under subsection (1) commits an offence under this Act. Examination of person acquainted with case"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
