<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_66__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law, a person accused of an offence to which subsection (1) applies shall not be bound to answer any questions relating to the case after any caution as referred to in paragraph (2)(b) has been administered to him. No cost or damages arising from seizure to be recoverable"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_67> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VIII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
