<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A foreign limited liability partnership shall ensure that the particulars of every person who acts as compliance officer of the foreign limited liability partnership and his consent to act as such are lodged with the Registrar."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
