<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The compliance officer shall give notice in writing of his intention to vacate the office to the foreign limited liability partnership."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_46> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
