<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "If a foreign limited liability partnership ceases to have a place of business or to carry on business in Malaysia, it shall lodge with the Registrar a notice of that fact within seven days after the date of cessation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
