<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The cessation of business shall take effect upon the lodgement of the notice under subsection (1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
