<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "On and from that date of the lodgement of the notice under subsection (1), the obligation of the foreign limited liability partnership to lodge any document with the Registrar shall cease except those documents that ought to have been lodged before such date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
