<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon the endorsement of appointment or appointment of an approved liquidator under subsection (2), or appointment of an approved liquidator under subsection (3), the Court shall be deemed to have ordered that the foreign limited liability partnership be wound-up."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
