<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "the conventional partnership, if registered under the Registration of Businesses Act 1956, shall be removed from the register of businesses maintained under that Act, and the private company shall be removed from the register of companies maintained under the Companies Act 1965."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
