<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "In this Part, “date of registration” means the date as specified in the notice of registration issued under subsection 32(1). Pending proceedings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
