<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_36__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "for any reference to the conventional partnership or private company, as the case may be, there were substituted in respect of anything to be done on or after the date of registration a reference to the limited liability partnership. Existing contracts, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_37> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_37> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "37" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
