<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_39__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any authority or power conferred on the conventional partnership or private company which is in force immediately before the date of registration shall take effect and operate from that date as if it were conferred on the limited liability partnership. Non-application of sections 33 to 39"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_40> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
