<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_41__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding sections 33 to 39, every partner of a conventional partnership that has converted to a limited liability partnership shall continue to be personally liable, jointly and severally with the limited liability partnership, for the liabilities and obligations of the conventional partnership which were incurred prior to the conversion or which arose from any contract entered into prior to the conversion."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_41__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_41> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
