<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_42__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A limited liability partnership which fails to comply with subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit and, in the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not exceeding five hundred ringgit for each day during which the offence continues after conviction. Existing statutory books, registers, records, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
