<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The mutual rights and duties of the partners and the mutual rights and duties of a limited liability partnership and its partners shall be determined, subject to the terms of any limited liability partnership agreement, by the provisions in this Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_2> <https://schema.org/text> "All the partners of a limited liability partnership are entitled to share equally in the capital and profits of the limited liability partnership."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_3__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
