<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The limited liability partnership must indemnify each partner in respect of payments made and personal liabilities incurred by that partner—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_3__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@/~sched_2__para_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/13/eng@> .
